    - target: {fileID: 3650370730020817671, guid: 865a393ffc72f674081048c5d8441f4e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "A Venturi nozzle can be used for flow rate measurements during measurements
        of the pressure loss \u2206p between largest and smallest diameter of the
        tube, as the flow rate factor K is available for the user by the manufacturer
        of a Venturi nozzle.\n\nIf the flow rate factor is unknown, it can be determined
        from the pressure loss \u2206p and the measured flow rate Q:\n\nK = Q \xF7
        \u221A(\u2206p)\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
